Notes
This page has no COHERENT Lexicon article behind it, and no COHERENT holding
carries this command: it was written for this port, and this page was written
here from its source.  None of Mark Williams Company's text is in it.

A setuid program that runs whoami gets the name of the owner it is running as,
not of the person who typed the command.  There is no option to ask for the
real user id instead, and this system ships no id(1) to print both.

